// two-files.maxtest — The per-file header and the `N tests across 2 files.` line, neither of which a
// single-file run can show.
//
// One spawning `test` per file — `fixtures.maxtest`'s header owns why.

test 'two-files reports a per-file header and a two-file total'
	checkFixture("two-files")
end 'two-files reports a per-file header and a two-file total'
